WHAT THE DATA IS

Both datasets are synthetic. Every document in them was generated from a seed. Every person, address, account number,
article and amount in them is invented, and so is every company name, with two exceptions: one Portuguese company is
named after the publisher, Docupath, and the freight invoices print a vessel name that carries a real shipping line's
name, with real container-owner codes. Any other resemblance to a real one is coincidence.

This repository contains no customer documents, no customer names and no values from customers' documents.
